    pres: ["Irritable, tearful and complains of tummy aches on school mornings for six weeks", "Has stopped drawing, which she loved"],
    pred: ["Sensitive, anxious child", "Years of loud fights between her parents"],
    prec: ["Father moved out three months ago and visits rarely"],
